{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16790","headline":"奉和圣制三日书怀因以示百寮 · 崔元翰","name":"奉和圣制三日书怀因以示百寮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佳节上元巳，芳时属暮春。\n流觞想兰亭，捧劒传金人。\n风轻水初绿，日迟花更新。\n天文信昭回，皇道颇敷陈。\n恭己每从俭，清心常保真。\n戒兹游衍乐，书以示羣臣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔元翰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16790.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16790","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}